Riseonly patch on zed 6b2aa1c (Apache-2.0 crate gpui_wgpu), applied by scripts/vendor-gpui.py after 0005.
The wgpu renderer (Linux) draws OwnedSurfaceFrame::bgra: one texture per BGRA stream in the colour atlas
format (Bgra8Unorm, or Rgba8Unorm with a red/blue swap in the shader), uploaded with Queue::write_texture
on a new generation, sampled by fs_surface without YCbCr and returned premultiplied, or straight when the
pipeline blends straight alpha (globals.premultiplied_alpha), so a WebM sticker blends over what lies
beneath (P147 lin).

